  "description": "High-performance, AOT-friendly, source-generated in-process mediator for .NET — a near drop-in replacement for MediatR. Bundles the core abstractions, the Microsoft.Extensions.DependencyInjection integration (AddFastMediatR), and the Roslyn source generator that emits zero-reflection dispatch. Includes an exception handling pipeline: IRequestExceptionHandler suppresses failures with a fallback response, IRequestExceptionAction observes them for logging and other side effects, both matched against the exception type hierarchy.",
